MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

All plots created by ez are ggplot2 objects
(http://had.co.nz/ggplot2/) so you can modify them using ggplot2
commands. For example, if you created an object "my_plot" and want to
change the colors of the lines as you mention:

my_plot = my_plot + scale_colour_manual(values=c('red','blue'))

